    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>A 1980s teenage hacker recruited as an unwitting asset before being Embraced in 1985 following a leukemia scare. Priest of Black Eagle Consulting, Inc. since 1993, he is detached but useful as the pack's spiritual advisor.</p><p>See Richard B. Weinstein's entry for the pack's shared background as Black Eagle Consulting, Inc.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Armor keeps an emotional distance from the pack's affairs even while guiding its doctrinal life, treating faith and ritual with the same detached technical precision he once brought to hacking.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed):</strong> Dominate 1, Obfuscate 1, Obtenebration 2, Potence 1.</p>",
    "notes": "Convert Disciplines to owned power Items: Dominate 1, Obfuscate 1, Obtenebration 2, Potence 1.",
